// Title: UAC Bypass via Sdclt
// Rule ID: 5b872a46-3b90-45c1-8419-f675db8053aa
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002, car.2019-04-001
